{#- Experiment 5 — quasi-static BER vs SNR.

Single A->B replay channel driven by one quasi-static snapshot (.octt
with linear per-tap delay ramps). Modem A fires PRBS evaluation
messages; modem B scores the cargo and prints Uncoded/Coded BER counts
on its CDC console. Wenz noise stays fixed while gain_db sweeps the
signal level, so gain_db is the SNR axis up to a per-setup calibration
offset.

offset_s equals the trajectory frame interval so every message plays
inside interior Catmull-Rom segments, where linear delay ramps (and so
per-tap Doppler) are reproduced exactly. advance_per_message is false:
every message sees the same frozen channel.

Variables:
  snapshot          (int)   snapshot index within the ensemble (labeling)
  gain_tag          (str)   filesystem-safe gain label, e.g. m52p5
  seed              (int)   random_seed for this cell
  gain_db           (float) swept channel gain
  trajectory_file   (str)   absolute path to the snapshot .octt
  record_dt_s       (float) trajectory frame interval (default 1.0)
  sea_state         (int)   Wenz sea state, fixed across the sweep (default 3)
  range_m           (float) bulk propagation range (default 300)
  max_message_duration_s (float) EVAL message ceiling (default 5.0)
  modem_a_serial    (str)   USB serial for modem A (default OA-2-1)
  modem_b_serial    (str)   USB serial for modem B (default OA-2-2)
  tvr_a_db, rvr_a_db(float) modem A transducer params (defaults 172, -200)
  tvr_b_db, rvr_b_db(float) modem B transducer params (defaults 170, -200)
  output_directory  (str)   per-cell output dir (injected by Sweep runner)
-#}
name: exp5_snap{{ snapshot|int }}_{{ gain_tag }}_seed{{ seed|int }}
description: >
  Quasi-static BER cell: snapshot {{ snapshot|int }},
  gain {{ "%.1f"|format(gain_db|float) }} dB, seed {{ seed|int }}.
  PRBS evaluation messages from modem A through a frozen replay channel;
  modem B reports cargo BER.

environment:
  sound_speed_m_s: 1500.0
  saltwater: true
  spreading_model: spherical
  max_message_duration_s: {{ "%.1f"|format(max_message_duration_s|default(5.0)|float) }}

transducers:
  T-001:
    tvr_db: {{ "%.3f"|format(tvr_a_db|default(172.0)|float) }}
    rvr_db: {{ "%.3f"|format(rvr_a_db|default(-200.0)|float) }}
  T-002:
    tvr_db: {{ "%.3f"|format(tvr_b_db|default(170.0)|float) }}
    rvr_db: {{ "%.3f"|format(rvr_b_db|default(-200.0)|float) }}

modems:
  - id: modem_a
    usb_serial: "{{ modem_a_serial | default('OA-2-1') }}"
    transducer_id: "T-001"
  - id: modem_b
    usb_serial: "{{ modem_b_serial | default('OA-2-2') }}"
    transducer_id: "T-002"

channels:
  - from: modem_a
    to: modem_b
    range_m: {{ "%.3f"|format(range_m|default(300.0)|float) }}
    gain_db: {{ "%.3f"|format(gain_db|float) }}
    mode: replay
    replay:
      trajectory_file: "{{ trajectory_file }}"
      offset_s: {{ "%.3f"|format(record_dt_s|default(1.0)|float) }}
      advance_per_message: false
      wrap_if_remaining_lt_s: 0.0

noise:
  wenz_sea_state: {{ sea_state | default(3) | int }}
  min_margin_above_afe_db: 10.0
  saltwater: false

logging:
  log_raw_tx: false
  log_raw_rx: false
  log_processed: false
  output_directory: "{{ output_directory }}"
  file_format: wav
  log_processing_time_histogram: true
  log_message_events: true

random_seed: {{ seed|int }}
